{"id":"vol9-08","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-08/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":378.25,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.3,"text":"Now turn to section 2 on page 3.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.24],["turn",0.24,0.58],["to",0.58,0.8],["section",0.8,1.06],["2",1.06,1.64],["on",1.64,2.4],["page",2.4,2.7],["3.",2.7,3.3]]},{"start":4.78,"end":8.62,"text":"Part 2 You will hear a principal of a school talking","words":[["Part",4.78,5.04],["2",5.04,5.44],["You",5.44,6.46],["will",6.46,6.62],["hear",6.62,6.8],["a",6.8,6.92],["principal",6.92,7.28],["of",7.28,7.58],["a",7.58,7.7],["school",7.7,7.98],["talking",7.98,8.62]]},{"start":8.62,"end":14.24,"text":"to a group of parents about a three-day trip for pupils to an outdoor education centre.","words":[["to",8.62,8.88],["a",8.88,9.0],["group",9.0,9.16],["of",9.16,9.32],["parents",9.32,9.72],["about",9.72,10.44],["a",10.44,10.66],["three",10.66,10.86],["-day",10.86,11.04],["trip",11.04,11.32],["for",11.32,11.52],["pupils",11.52,11.9],["to",11.9,12.64],["an",12.64,12.8],["outdoor",12.8,13.14],["education",13.14,13.72],["centre.",13.72,14.24]]},{"start":15.14,"end":18.92,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 16.","words":[["First,",15.14,15.6],["you",16.02,16.18],["have",16.18,16.36],["some",16.36,16.52],["time",16.52,16.82],["to",16.82,17.02],["look",17.02,17.14],["at",17.14,17.3],["questions",17.3,17.68],["11",17.68,18.3],["to",18.3,18.52],["16.",18.52,18.92]]},{"start":39.6,"end":42.6,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 16.","words":[["Now",39.6,39.88],["listen",39.88,40.14],["carefully",40.14,40.58],["and",40.58,40.86],["answer",40.86,41.12],["questions",41.12,41.54],["11",41.54,42.04],["to",42.04,42.22],["16.",42.22,42.6]]},{"start":43.3,"end":46.76,"text":"Good evening. It's good to see so many parents here.","words":[["Good",43.3,43.62],["evening.",43.62,43.9],["It's",44.6,44.86],["good",44.86,45.02],["to",45.02,45.18],["see",45.18,45.42],["so",45.42,45.7],["many",45.7,45.94],["parents",45.94,46.38],["here.",46.38,46.76]]},{"start":46.76,"end":50.64,"text":"centre. Let me begin by explaining why we go to the","words":[["centre.",46.76,46.82],["Let",47.56,48.02],["me",48.02,48.18],["begin",48.18,48.5],["by",48.5,48.76],["explaining",48.76,49.24],["why",49.24,49.86],["we",49.86,50.1],["go",50.1,50.32],["to",50.32,50.5],["the",50.5,50.64]]},{"start":50.64,"end":57.32,"text":"outdoor education centre. Well, by age 10 we feel the children are ready for a trip away","words":[["outdoor",50.64,51.02],["education",51.02,51.58],["centre.",51.58,52.2],["Well,",53.06,53.44],["by",53.84,54.0],["age",54.0,54.3],["10",54.3,54.62],["we",54.62,55.2],["feel",55.2,55.48],["the",55.48,55.64],["children",55.64,56.0],["are",56.0,56.28],["ready",56.28,56.5],["for",56.5,56.72],["a",56.72,56.88],["trip",56.88,57.0],["away",57.0,57.32]]},{"start":57.32,"end":63.04,"text":"from home but still in a safe environment and under the guidance of a familiar adult.","words":[["from",57.32,57.54],["home",57.54,57.94],["but",57.94,58.58],["still",58.58,58.94],["in",58.94,59.16],["a",59.16,59.3],["safe",59.3,59.58],["environment",59.58,60.12],["and",60.12,60.68],["under",60.68,60.98],["the",60.98,61.14],["guidance",61.14,61.48],["of",61.48,62.0],["a",62.0,62.1],["familiar",62.1,62.46],["adult.",62.46,63.04]]},{"start":63.98,"end":69.44,"text":"At the school we strongly believe children should be encouraged to try different things","words":[["At",63.98,64.62],["the",64.62,64.78],["school",64.78,65.16],["we",65.16,65.64],["strongly",65.64,66.0],["believe",66.0,66.42],["children",66.42,66.86],["should",66.86,67.18],["be",67.18,67.38],["encouraged",67.38,67.84],["to",67.84,68.34],["try",68.34,68.6],["different",68.6,68.96],["things",68.96,69.44]]},{"start":69.78,"end":74.84,"text":"and not give up when it gets difficult. And that's what the centre is all about,","words":[["and",69.78,70.1],["not",70.1,70.32],["give",70.32,70.58],["up",70.58,70.84],["when",70.84,71.22],["