e in with their best friends. So do make them","words":[["guarantee",98.28,98.8],["your",98.8,99.3],["child",99.3,99.68],["will",99.68,99.86],["be",99.86,100.04],["in",100.04,100.28],["with",100.28,100.46],["their",100.46,100.66],["best",100.66,100.88],["friends.",100.88,101.34],["So",102.0,102.34],["do",102.34,102.5],["make",102.5,102.76],["them",102.76,102.98]]},{"start":102.98,"end":108.22,"text":"aware of this. Now, you should have received a list with the clothing the children will","words":[["aware",102.98,103.26],["of",103.26,103.5],["this.",103.5,103.7],["Now,",104.52,104.82],["you",105.16,105.3],["should",105.3,105.48],["have",105.48,105.64],["received",105.64,105.98],["a",105.98,106.2],["list",106.2,106.46],["with",106.46,106.86],["the",106.86,107.02],["clothing",107.02,107.34],["the",107.34,107.62],["children",107.62,107.94],["will",107.94,108.22]]},{"start":108.22,"end":113.64,"text":"need in their backpack. But there are some extras. Please provide a packet of biscuits","words":[["need",108.22,108.48],["in",108.48,108.66],["their",108.66,108.82],["backpack.",108.82,109.16],["But",110.08,110.34],["there",110.34,110.5],["are",110.5,110.72],["some",110.72,110.98],["extras.",110.98,111.4],["Please",112.0,112.24],["provide",112.24,112.64],["a",112.64,112.86],["packet",112.86,113.08],["of",113.08,113.3],["biscuits",113.3,113.64]]},{"start":113.64,"end":119.66,"text":"or maybe fruit bars. But these need to go in the box in the school hall, not with the","words":[["or",113.64,114.26],["maybe",114.26,114.54],["fruit",114.54,114.82],["bars.",114.82,115.24],["But",115.82,116.06],["these",116.06,116.32],["need",116.32,116.58],["to",116.58,116.78],["go",116.78,116.94],["in",116.94,117.16],["the",117.16,117.26],["box",117.26,117.54],["in",117.54,117.86],["the",117.86,118.0],["school",118.0,118.24],["hall,",118.24,118.68],["not",118.96,119.3],["with",119.3,119.54],["the",119.54,119.66]]},{"start":119.66,"end":126.22,"text":"children. Actually, what we do need in the backpacks are bags for cleaning up and for","words":[["children.",119.66,120.04],["Actually,",120.92,121.46],["what",121.98,122.18],["we",122.18,122.38],["do",122.38,122.6],["need",122.6,122.86],["in",122.86,123.08],["the",123.08,123.18],["backpacks",123.18,123.76],["are",123.76,124.2],["bags",124.2,124.58],["for",124.58,124.88],["cleaning",124.88,125.18],["up",125.18,125.52],["and",125.52,126.02],["for",126.02,126.22]]},{"start":126.22,"end":132.96,"text":"wet clothing, so plastic ones please. A torch is a good idea, but don't worry about","words":[["wet",126.22,126.4],["clothing,",126.4,126.82],["so",127.26,127.62],["plastic",127.62,128.22],["ones",128.22,128.56],["please.",128.56,128.9],["A",129.88,130.06],["torch",130.06,130.3],["is",130.3,130.84],["a",130.84,130.94],["good",130.94,131.08],["idea,",131.08,131.5],["but",131.82,132.16],["don't",132.16,132.42],["worry",132.42,132.72],["about",132.72,132.96]]},{"start":132.96,"end":139.14,"text":"putting money in because there's nothing to buy. While we're on the subject let's talk about some","words":[["putting",132.96,133.28],["money",133.28,133.58],["in",133.58,133.88],["because",133.88,134.34],["there's",134.34,134.64],["nothing",134.64,134.9],["to",134.9,135.14],["buy.",135.14,135.44],["While",136.5,137.02],["we're",137.02,137.24],["on",137.24,137.36],["the",137.36,137.5],["subject",137.5,137.88],["let's",137.88,138.46],["talk",138.46,138.64],["about",138.64,138.9],["some",138.9,139.14]]},{"start":139.14,"end":145.64,"text":"other items. Cell phones are permitted but they must be switched off at night and also off during","words":[["other",139.14,139.34],["items.",139.34,139.84],["Cell",140.7,140.88],["phones",140.88,141.2],["are",141.2,141.44],["permitted",141.44,141.78],["but",141.78,142.32],["they",142.32,142.48],["must",142.48,142.68],["be",142.68,142.88],["switched",142.88,143.16],["off",143.16,143.4],["at",143.4,143.58],["night",143.58,143.84],["and",143.84,144.4],["also",144.4,144.72],["off",144.72,145.18],["during",145.18,145.64]]},{"start":145.64,"end":152.96,"text":"the teaching sessions. Also for wood carving activities knives will be provided by the center","words":[["the",145.64,145.86],["teaching",145.86,146.14],["sessions.",146.14,146.6],["Also",147.72,148.2],["for",148.2,148.84],["wood",148.84,149.08],["carving",149.08,149.44],["activities",149.44,150.14],["knives",150.14,151.12],["will",151.12,151.5],["be",151.5,151.68],["provided",151.68,152.16],["by",152.16,152.48],["the",152.48,152.66],["center",152.66,152.96]]},{"start":152.96,"end":159.58,"text":"so children shouldn't bring them from home. Electronic games are banned so rather than","words":[["so",152.96,153.54],["children",153.54,153.98],["shouldn't",153.98,154.46],["bring",154.46,154.66],["them",154.66,154.82],["from",154.82,155.0],["home.",155.0,155.38],["Electronic",156.4,157.04],["games",157.04,157.58],["are",157.58,157.92],["banned",157.92,158.34],["so",158.34,158.94],["rather",158.94,159.3],["than",159.3,159.58]]},{"start":159.58,"end":163.02,"text":"bring one of these, children should bring quiet board games.","words":[["bring",159.58,159.8],["one",159.8,159.98],["of",159.98,160.14],["these,",160.14,160.44],["children",160.86,161.18],["should",161.18,161.52],["bring",161.52,161.78],["quiet",161.78,162.3],["board",162.3,162.64],["games.",162.64,163.02]]},{"start":164.26,"end":169.42,"text":"Turning to the question of parent attendance, in the past we've had too many volunteers","words":[["Turning",164.26,164.66],["to",164.66,164.92],["the",164.92,165.04],["question",165.04,165.34],["of",165.34,165.58],["parent",165.58,165.88],["attendance,",165.88,166.42],["in",167.04,167.22],["the",167.22,167.34],["past",167.34,167.72],["we've",167.72,168.06],["had",168.06,168.22],["too",168.22,168.44],["many",168.44,168.7],["volunteers",168.7,169.42]]},{"start":169.42,"end":173.58,"text":"so we have written names on bits of paper and pulled them out of the box.","words":[["so",169.42,170.08],["we",170.08,170.